    "directions": [
      "Place the flour, milk, baking powder, and salt in a mixing bowl and whisk or stir to mix.",
      "Add the shortening, cutting it in with two knives or a pastry blender; the mixture should feel sandy.",
      "Add the water and stir to obtain a soft, pliable dough.",
      "Turn the dough onto a lightly floured work surface and knead for 5 minutes.",
      "Wrap the dough in plastic wrap and let rest for 5 minutes. You’re ready to roll and grill it."
